Problem Statement:

            To Actively Control the vertical response of a Bus using an Actuator controlled by PID when the Bus goes over a Speed bump or a Step on road of 10 cm.
            

Requirements:

            1. The Response must damp down within 5 secs of crossing speed bump.
            2. only +/- 5% of Overshoot is allowed. i.e: (+/- 5 mm)


Vehicle Specifications:

(M1)    1/4 bus body mass                        2500 kg
(M2)    suspension mass                          320 kg
(K1)    spring constant of suspension system     80,000 N/m
(K2)    spring constant of wheel and tire        500,000 N/m
(b1)    damping constant of suspension system    350 N.s/m
(b2)    damping constant of wheel and tire       15,020 N.s/m




